:seed: filing-spine-303-ledger
@step Create the work unit for the filing target.
@setup aeat --format json app modelo work create --modelo 303 --year 2026 --period 1T
@step Calculate the quarter's IVA from the classified ledger.
@setup aeat --format json app modelo work calculate --modelo 303 --year 2026 --period 1T
@step Review all actions the tool has taken on this filing, in order.
@result aeat --format json app modelo work history --modelo 303 --year 2026 --period 1T
@expect exit_code == 0
